<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{#if firstName}}Hi {{firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>The VAT ID or tax number of <strong>{{fleetName}}</strong> was changed{{#if changedBy}} by {{changedBy}}{{/if}}. Before: {{#if previousTaxId}}{{previousTaxId}}{{else}}none{{/if}}. Now: {{#if taxIdRemoved}}none{{else}}{{newTaxId}}{{/if}}.</p>
<table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0' width='100%' style='border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;'><tr><td align='center' style='padding:24px 0;'><a href='{{fleetUrl}}' style='display:inline-block;background-color:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;'>Open Fleet Billing</a></td></tr></table>
<p style='color:#6b7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-size:14px;'>Invoices issued from now on print the new number. Invoices issued before keep the number they were issued with. Check the change if you did not expect it.</p>
